se-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploggrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetricgrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetrichttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Fix `AddAttributes`, `SetAttributes`, `SetBody` on `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log` to not mutate input. (#7403)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0`. (#7655)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.36.0`. (#7656)\\n\\n### Removed\\n\\n- Drop support for [Go 1.23]. (#7274)\\n\\n- Remove the `FilterProcessor` interface in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`. The `Enabled` method has been added to the `Processor` interface instead. All `Processor` implementations must now implement the `Enabled` method. Custom processors that do not filter records can implement `Enabled` to return `true`. (#7639)\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-REL-01]\\n\\n# Release: v1.39.0 — Release v1.39.0/v0.61.0/v0.15.0/v0.0.14\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/releases/tag/v1.39.0  \\n\\n**Author**: MrAlias  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-12-08T16:32:32Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-08T16:45:46Z  \\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploggrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploghttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetricgrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetrichttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracegrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracehttp 7372 fix addattribut setattribut setbodi on record in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log to not mutat input 7403 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 7655 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 360 7656 remov drop support for go 123 7274 remov the filterprocessor interfac in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log the enabl method ha been ad to the processor interfac instead all processor implement must now implement the enabl method custom processor that do not filter record can implement enabl to return true 7639 sourc id src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 releas v1 39 0 v0 61 0 v0 15 0 v0 0 14 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go releas tag v1 39 0 author mralia creat 2025 12 08t16 32 32z updat 2025 12 08t16 45 46z\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id